      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The preventive and therapeutic effects of bonnecor were shown in the experiments on awake and anesthetized rats under conditions of acute myocardial ischemia. It was concluded that the relieving influence of bonnecor on the course of acute myocardial ischemia was related to its antifibrillatory and antiarrhythmic properties."},
